      "explanation": "✅ คำตอบที่ถูกต้อง: ข้อ ค. TDF+FTC+DTG<br>🎯 ทำไมข้อนี้ถึงถูก: ตามแนวทางการตรวจรักษาและป้องกันการติดเชื้อเอชไอวีแห่งประเทศไทย (Thailand National HIV Guidelines) สูตรยาต้านไวรัสแนวทางแรกที่แนะนำให้ใช้ (preferred first-line regimen) ในผู้ใหญ่ที่ไม่มีข้อห้ามใช้ คือ Dolutegravir (DTG) ร่วมกับ Tenofovir disoproxil fumarate (TDF) และ Lamivudine (3TC) หรือ Emtricitabine (FTC) เช่น TDF + 3TC/FTC + DTG เนื่องจากประสิทธิภาพสูงและมี genetic barrier to resistance สูง<br>🔍 ข้ออื่นผิดเพราะอะไร:<br><br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>ก<br>.<br>T<br>D<br>F<br>+<br>F<br>T<br>C<br>+<br>R<br>P<br>V<br>:<br>R<br>i<br>l<br>p<br>i<br>v<br>i<br>r<br>i<br>n<br>e<br>แ<br>น<br>ะ<br>นำ<br>เ<br>ฉ<br>พำ<br>ะ<br>ใ<br>น<br>ผ<br>ู<br>้<br>ท<br>ี<br>่<br>ม<br>ี<br>b<br>a<br>s<br>e<br>l<br>i<br>n<br>e<br>v<br>i<br>r<br>a<br>l<br>l<br>o<br>a<br>d<br>น<br>้<br>อ<br>ย<br>ก<br>ว<br>่<br>า<br>1<br>0<br>0<br>0<br>0<br>0<br>c<br>o<br>p<br>i<br>e<br>s<br>/<br>m<br>L<br>แ<br>ล<br>ะ<br>C<br>D<br>4<br>มำ<br>ก<br>ก<br>ว<br>่<br>า<br>2<br>0<br>0<br>c<br>e<br>l<br>l<br>s<br>/<br>m<br>m<br>3<br>จ<br>ึ<br>ง<br>ไ<br>ม<br>่<br>ใ<br>ช<br>่<br>f<br>i<br>r<br>s<br>t<br>-<br>l<br>i<br>n<br>e<br>สำ<br>ก<br>ล<br><br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>ข<br>.<br>T<br>D<br>F<br>+<br>3<br>T<br>C<br>+<br>E<br>F<br>V<br>:<br>เ<br>ป<br>็<br>น<br>ส<br>ู<br>ต<br>ร<br>เ<br>ด<br>ิ<br>ม<br>ใ<br>น<br>อ<br>ด<br>ี<br>ต<br>ป<br>ั<br>จ<br>จ<br>ุ<br>บ<br>ั<br>น<br>ถ<br>ู<br>ก<br>แ<br>ท<br>น<br>ท<br>ี<br>่<br>ด<br>้<br>ว<br>ย<br>ส<br>ู<br>ต<br>ร<br>D<br>T<br>G<br>-<br>b<br>a<br>s<br>e<br>d<br>เ<br>น<br>ื<br>่<br>อ<br>ง<br>จำ<br>ก<br>E<br>f<br>a<br>v<br>i<br>r<br>e<br>n<br>z<br>ม<br>ี<br>ผ<br>ล<br>ข<br>้<br>า<br>ง<br>เ<br>ค<br>ี<br>ย<br>ง<br>ต<br>่<br>อ<br>ร<br>ะ<br>บ<br>บ<br>ป<br>ร<br>ะ<br>สำ<br>ท<br>(<br>C<br>N<br>S<br>a<br>d<br>v<br>e<br>r<br>s<br>e<br>e<br>f<br>f<br>e<br>c<br>t<br>s<br>)<br>แ<br>ล<br>ะ<br>ม<br>ี<br>อ<br>ั<br>ต<br>รำ<br>กำ<br>ร<br>ด<br>ื<br>้<br>อ<br>ยำ<br>ส<br>ู<br>ง<br>ก<br>ว<br>่<br>า<br><br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>ง<br>.<br>A<br>B<br>C<br>+<br>3<br>T<br>C<br>+<br>D<br>T<br>G<br>:<br>เ<br>ป<br>็<br>น<br>ส<br>ู<br>ต<br>ร<br>ทำ<br>ง<br>เ<br>ล<br>ื<br>อ<br>ก<br>สำ<br>ห<br>ร<br>ั<br>บ<br>ผ<br>ู<br>้<br>ท<br>ี<br>่<br>ม<br>ี<br>ภำ<br>ว<br>ะ<br>ไ<br>ต<br>เ<br>ส<br>ื<br>่<br>อ<br>ม<br>(<br>C<br>r<br>C<br>l<br><<br>5<br>0<br>m<br>L<br>/<br>m<br>i<br>n<br>)<br>ห<br>ร<br>ื<br>อ<br>ก<br>ร<br>ะ<br>ด<br>ู<br>ก<br>พ<br>ร<br>ุ<br>น<br>แ<br>ต<br>่<br>ต<br>้<br>อ<br>ง<br>ต<br>ร<br>ว<br>จ<br>ค<br>ั<br>ด<br>ก<br>ร<br>อ<br>ง<br>H<br>L<br>A<br>-<br>B<br>5<br>7<br>0<br>1<br>ก<br>่<br>อ<br>น<br>ใ<br>ช<br>้<br>เ<br>ส<br>ม<br>อ<br>จ<br>ึ<br>ง<br>ไ<br>ม<br>่<br>ใ<br>ช<br>่<br>p<br>r<br>e<br>f<br>e<br>r<br>r<br>e<br>d<br>r<br>e<br>g<br>i<br>m<br>e<br>n<br>ท<br>ั<br>่<br>ว<br>ไ<br>ป<br><br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>จ<br>.<br>A<br>Z<br>T<br>+<br>F<br>T<br>C<br>+<br>D<br>T<br>G<br>:<br>ไ<br>ม<br>่<br>น<br>ิ<br>ย<br>ม<br>ใ<br>ช<br>้<br>Z<br>i<br>d<br>o<br>v<br>u<br>d<br>i<br>n<br>e<br>(<br>A<br>Z<br>T<br>)<br>เ<br>ป<br>็<br>น<br>ส<br>ู<br>ต<br>ร<br>แ<br>ร<br>ก<br>เ<br>น<br>ื<br>่<br>อ<br>ง<br>จำ<br>ก<br>ผ<br>ล<br>ข<br>้<br>า<br>ง<br>เ<br>ค<br>ี<br>ย<br>ง<br>ก<br>ด<br>ไ<br>ข<br>ก<br>ร<br>ะ<br>ด<br>ู<br>ก<br>โ<br>ล<br>ห<br>ิ<br>ต<br>จำ<br>ง<br>แ<br>ล<br>ะ<br>l<br>i<br>p<br>o<br>d<br>y<br>s<br>t<br>r<br>o<br>p<br>h<br>y",
