      "question": "ข้อใดไม่ใช่อาการแสดงของผู้ป่วย Parkinson’s disease (1) Hypertension (2) Resting tremor (3) Impaired balance (4) Slowness of movement (5) Stiffness to limb movement MCQ 11 | 1/2557 | Page 11",
