      "explanation": "✅ คำตอบที่ถูกต้อง: ข้อ ก. ฤทธิ์ของยา AchE เพิ่มขึ้น<br>🎯 ทำไมข้อนี้ถึงถูก: ยาในกลุ่ม Acetylcholinesterase inhibitors บางชนิด เช่น Donepezil และ Galantamine ถูกเมแทบอไลต์ผ่านเอนไซม์ CYP2D6 (และ CYP3A4) เป็นหลัก เมื่อให้ร่วมกับสารยับยั้ง CYP2D6 inhibitor (เช่น Fluoxetine, Paroxetine, Bupropion) จะลดการกำจัดยา ส่งผลให้ระดับยาและฤทธิ์ของยา Acetylcholinesterase inhibitor ในร่างกายเพิ่มสูงขึ้น<br>🔍 ข้ออื่นผิดเพราะอะไร:<br><br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>ข<br>.<br>(<br>ทำ<br>ใ<br>ห<br>้<br>เ<br>ก<br>ิ<br>ด<br>b<br>r<br>a<br>d<br>y<br>c<br>a<br>r<br>d<br>i<br>a<br>)<br>:<br>แ<br>ม<br>้<br>ว<br>่<br>า<br>c<br>h<br>o<br>l<br>i<br>n<br>e<br>r<br>g<br>i<br>c<br>e<br>x<br>c<br>e<br>s<br>s<br>อำ<br>จ<br>ส<br>่<br>ง<br>ผ<br>ล<br>ใ<br>ห<br>้<br>เ<br>ก<br>ิ<br>ด<br>b<br>r<br>a<br>d<br>y<br>c<br>a<br>r<br>d<br>i<br>a<br>แ<br>ล<br>ะ<br>s<br>y<br>n<br>c<br>o<br>p<br>e<br>ไ<br>ด<br>้<br>แ<br>ต<br>่<br>b<br>r<br>a<br>d<br>y<br>c<br>a<br>r<br>d<br>i<br>a<br>เ<br>ป<br>็<br>น<br>อำ<br>กำ<br>ร<br>ทำ<br>ง<br>ค<br>ล<br>ิ<br>น<br>ิ<br>ก<br>ป<br>ลำ<br>ย<br>ทำ<br>ง<br>ไ<br>ม<br>่<br>ใ<br>ช<br>่<br>ผ<br>ล<br>ก<br>ร<br>ะ<br>ท<br>บ<br>ทำ<br>ง<br>เ<br>ภ<br>ส<br>ั<br>ช<br>จ<br>ล<br>น<br>ศำ<br>ส<br>ต<br>ร<br>์<br>โ<br>ด<br>ย<br>ต<br>ร<br>ง<br>ข<br>อ<br>ง<br>กำ<br>ร<br>ย<br>ั<br>บ<br>ย<br>ั<br>้<br>ง<br>เ<br>อ<br>น<br>ไ<br>ซ<br>ม<br>์<br><br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>ค<br>.<br>(<br>ทำ<br>ใ<br>ห<br>้<br>ใ<br>จ<br>ส<br>ั<br>่<br>น<br>ร<br>่<br>ว<br>ม<br>ก<br>ั<br>บ<br>อำ<br>กำ<br>ร<br>ต<br>ะ<br>ค<br>ร<br>ิ<br>ว<br>)<br>:<br>กำ<br>ร<br>ก<br>ร<br>ะ<br>ต<br>ุ<br>้<br>น<br>ร<br>ะ<br>บ<br>บ<br>p<br>a<br>r<br>a<br>s<br>y<br>m<br>p<br>a<br>t<br>h<br>e<br>t<br>i<br>c<br>ม<br>ั<br>ก<br>ทำ<br>ใ<br>ห<br>้<br>ห<br>ั<br>ว<br>ใ<br>จ<br>เ<br>ต<br>้<br>น<br>ช<br>้<br>า<br>(<br>b<br>r<br>a<br>d<br>y<br>c<br>a<br>r<br>d<br>i<br>a<br>)<br>ไ<br>ม<br>่<br>ใ<br>ช<br>่<br>ใ<br>จ<br>ส<br>ั<br>่<br>น<br>(<br>t<br>a<br>c<br>h<br>y<br>c<br>a<br>r<br>d<br>i<br>a<br>)<br><br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>ง<br>.<br>(<br>อำ<br>จ<br>ทำ<br>ใ<br>ห<br>้<br>เ<br>ก<br>ิ<br>ด<br>อำ<br>กำ<br>ร<br>ส<br>ั<br>บ<br>ส<br>น<br>ห<br>ร<br>ื<br>อ<br>เ<br>พ<br>้<br>อ<br>(<br>d<br>e<br>l<br>i<br>r<br>i<br>u<br>m<br>)<br>)<br>:<br>สำ<br>ร<br>ต<br>้<br>า<br>น<br>โ<br>ค<br>ล<br>ิ<br>เ<br>น<br>อ<br>ร<br>์<br>จ<br>ิ<br>ก<br>(<br>a<br>n<br>t<br>i<br>c<br>h<br>o<br>l<br>i<br>n<br>e<br>r<br>g<br>i<br>c<br>s<br>)<br>เ<br>ป<br>็<br>น<br>สำ<br>เ<br>ห<br>ต<br>ุ<br>ห<br>ล<br>ั<br>ก<br>ข<br>อ<br>ง<br>d<br>e<br>l<br>i<br>r<br>i<br>u<br>m<br>ส<br>่<br>ว<br>น<br>ยำ<br>ก<br>ล<br>ุ<br>่<br>ม<br>น<br>ี<br>้<br>ช<br>่<br>ว<br>ย<br>เ<br>พ<br>ิ<br>่<br>ม<br>a<br>c<br>e<br>t<br>y<br>l<br>c<br>h<br>o<br>l<br>i<br>n<br>e<br>ใ<br>น<br>ส<br>ม<br>อ<br>ง<br>จ<br>ึ<br>ง<br>ไ<br>ม<br>่<br>ไ<br>ด<br>้<br>ม<br>ี<br>ผ<br>ล<br>ห<br>ล<br>ั<br>ก<br>ทำ<br>ใ<br>ห<br>้<br>เ<br>ก<br>ิ<br>ด<br>d<br>e<br>l<br>i<br>r<br>i<br>u<br>m<br><br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>จ<br>.<br>(<br>ไ<br>ม<br>่<br>ม<br>ี<br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>ใ<br>ด<br>ถ<br>ู<br>ก<br>)<br>:<br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>ก<br>.<br>ถ<br>ู<br>ก<br>ต<br>้<br>อ<br>ง<br>ตำ<br>ม<br>ห<br>ล<br>ั<br>ก<br>เ<br>ภ<br>ส<br>ั<br>ช<br>จ<br>ล<br>น<br>ศำ<br>ส<br>ต<br>ร<br>์",
