      "explanation": "✅ คำตอบที่ถูกต้อง: ข้อ จ. Lung function Spirometry<br>🎯 ทำไมข้อนี้ถึงถูก: ตามแนวทางเวชปฏิบัติ Global Initiative for Chronic Obstructive Lung Disease (GOLD Guidelines) การตรวจสมรรถภาพปอดด้วย Spirometry (Post-bronchodilator Spirometry) จัดเป็น Gold Standard ในการวินิจฉัยโรคปอดอุดกั้นเรื้อรัง (COPD) โดยยืนยันการวินิจฉัยเมื่อพบค่า post-bronchodilator FEV1/FVC น้อยกว่า 0.70<br>🔍 ข้ออื่นผิดเพราะอะไร:<br><br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>ก<br>.<br>(<br>S<br>p<br>u<br>t<br>u<br>m<br>c<br>u<br>l<br>t<br>u<br>r<br>e<br>)<br>:<br>เ<br>ป<br>็<br>น<br>กำ<br>ร<br>ต<br>ร<br>ว<br>จ<br>เ<br>พำ<br>ะ<br>เ<br>ช<br>ื<br>้<br>อ<br>เ<br>พ<br>ื<br>่<br>อ<br>หำ<br>เ<br>ช<br>ื<br>้<br>อ<br>ก<br>่<br>อ<br>โ<br>ร<br>ค<br>ใ<br>น<br>ภำ<br>ว<br>ะ<br>ต<br>ิ<br>ด<br>เ<br>ช<br>ื<br>้<br>อ<br>ทำ<br>ง<br>เ<br>ด<br>ิ<br>น<br>หำ<br>ย<br>ใ<br>จ<br>เ<br>ฉ<br>ี<br>ย<br>บ<br>พ<br>ล<br>ั<br>น<br>ไ<br>ม<br>่<br>ใ<br>ช<br>่<br>เ<br>ค<br>ร<br>ื<br>่<br>อ<br>ง<br>ม<br>ื<br>อ<br>ว<br>ิ<br>น<br>ิ<br>จ<br>ฉ<br>ั<br>ย<br>โ<br>ร<br>ค<br>C<br>O<br>P<br>D<br><br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>ข<br>.<br>(<br>P<br>h<br>y<br>s<br>i<br>c<br>a<br>l<br>E<br>x<br>a<br>m<br>i<br>n<br>a<br>t<br>i<br>o<br>n<br>)<br>:<br>กำ<br>ร<br>ต<br>ร<br>ว<br>จ<br>ร<br>่<br>า<br>ง<br>กำ<br>ย<br>ม<br>ี<br>ค<br>วำ<br>ม<br>ไ<br>ว<br>ต<br>่<br>ำ<br>ไ<br>ม<br>่<br>สำ<br>มำ<br>ร<br>ถ<br>แ<br>ย<br>ก<br>โ<br>ร<br>ค<br>ห<br>ร<br>ื<br>อ<br>ย<br>ื<br>น<br>ย<br>ั<br>น<br>ภำ<br>ว<br>ะ<br>a<br>i<br>r<br>f<br>l<br>o<br>w<br>l<br>i<br>m<br>i<br>t<br>a<br>t<br>i<br>o<br>n<br>ไ<br>ด<br>้<br>อ<br>ย<br>่<br>า<br>ง<br>แ<br>น<br>่<br>น<br>อ<br>น<br><br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>ค<br>.<br>(<br>C<br>o<br>m<br>p<br>l<br>e<br>t<br>e<br>b<br>l<br>o<br>o<br>d<br>c<br>o<br>u<br>n<br>t<br>)<br>:<br>ใ<br>ช<br>้<br>ป<br>ร<br>ะ<br>เ<br>ม<br>ิ<br>น<br>ภำ<br>ว<br>ะ<br>ซ<br>ี<br>ด<br>กำ<br>ร<br>ต<br>ิ<br>ด<br>เ<br>ช<br>ื<br>้<br>อ<br>ห<br>ร<br>ื<br>อ<br>p<br>o<br>l<br>y<br>c<br>y<br>t<br>h<br>e<br>m<br>i<br>a<br>ร<br>่<br>ว<br>ม<br>ไ<br>ม<br>่<br>ใ<br>ช<br>่<br>เ<br>ก<br>ณ<br>ฑ<br>์<br>มำ<br>ต<br>ร<br>ฐำ<br>น<br>ใ<br>น<br>กำ<br>ร<br>ว<br>ิ<br>น<br>ิ<br>จ<br>ฉ<br>ั<br>ย<br>กำ<br>ร<br>อ<br>ุ<br>ด<br>ก<br>ั<br>้<br>น<br>ข<br>อ<br>ง<br>ห<br>ล<br>อ<br>ด<br>ล<br>ม<br><br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>ง<br>.<br>(<br>P<br>e<br>a<br>k<br>f<br>l<br>o<br>w<br>m<br>e<br>t<br>e<br>r<br>)<br>:<br>เ<br>ป<br>็<br>น<br>เ<br>ค<br>ร<br>ื<br>่<br>อ<br>ง<br>ม<br>ื<br>อ<br>ว<br>ั<br>ด<br>P<br>e<br>a<br>k<br>E<br>x<br>p<br>i<br>r<br>a<br>t<br>o<br>r<br>y<br>F<br>l<br>o<br>w<br>(<br>P<br>E<br>F<br>)<br>ท<br>ี<br>่<br>ม<br>ี<br>ค<br>วำ<br>ม<br>แ<br>ป<br>ร<br>ป<br>ร<br>ว<br>น<br>ส<br>ู<br>ง<br>เ<br>ห<br>มำ<br>ะ<br>สำ<br>ห<br>ร<br>ั<br>บ<br>ม<br>อ<br>น<br>ิ<br>เ<br>ต<br>อ<br>ร<br>์<br>อำ<br>กำ<br>ร<br>ห<br>อ<br>บ<br>ห<br>ื<br>ด<br>(<br>A<br>s<br>t<br>h<br>m<br>a<br>m<br>o<br>n<br>i<br>t<br>o<br>r<br>i<br>n<br>g<br>)<br>แ<br>ต<br>่<br>ไ<br>ม<br>่<br>เ<br>พ<br>ี<br>ย<br>ง<br>พ<br>อ<br>สำ<br>ห<br>ร<br>ั<br>บ<br>กำ<br>ร<br>ว<br>ิ<br>น<br>ิ<br>จ<br>ฉ<br>ั<br>ย<br>C<br>O<br>P<br>D",
