      "answer": 2,
      "explanation": "✅ คำตอบที่ถูกต้อง: ข้อ ข. GOLD 2<br>🎯 ทำไมข้อนี้ถึงถูก: ตามการจัดระดับความรุนแรงของ Airflow Limitation ในผู้ป่วย COPD ตาม GOLD Guidelines (เมื่อ FEV1/FVC น้อยกว่า 0.70): GOLD 1 (Mild) คือ FEV1 ตั้งแต่ 80% predicted ขึ้นไป; GOLD 2 (Moderate) คือ 50% ถึงน้อยกว่า 80% predicted; GOLD 3 (Severe) คือ 30% ถึงน้อยกว่า 50% predicted; GOLD 4 (Very severe) คือ น้อยกว่า 30% predicted ดังนั้นค่า FEV1 75% จึงจัดอยู่ในระดับ GOLD 2 (Moderate)<br>🔍 ข้ออื่นผิดเพราะอะไร:<br><br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>ก<br>.<br>(<br>G<br>O<br>L<br>D<br>1<br>)<br>:<br>ร<br>ะ<br>ด<br>ั<br>บ<br>M<br>i<br>l<br>d<br>กำ<br>ห<br>น<br>ด<br>ค<br>่<br>า<br>p<br>o<br>s<br>t<br>-<br>b<br>r<br>o<br>n<br>c<br>h<br>o<br>d<br>i<br>l<br>a<br>t<br>o<br>r<br>F<br>E<br>V<br>1<br>ต<br>ั<br>้<br>ง<br>แ<br>ต<br>่<br>8<br>0<br>%<br>p<br>r<br>e<br>d<br>i<br>c<br>t<br>e<br>d<br>ข<br>ึ<br>้<br>น<br>ไ<br>ป<br><br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>ค<br>.<br>(<br>G<br>O<br>L<br>D<br>3<br>)<br>:<br>ร<br>ะ<br>ด<br>ั<br>บ<br>S<br>e<br>v<br>e<br>r<br>e<br>กำ<br>ห<br>น<br>ด<br>ค<br>่<br>า<br>p<br>o<br>s<br>t<br>-<br>b<br>r<br>o<br>n<br>c<br>h<br>o<br>d<br>i<br>l<br>a<br>t<br>o<br>r<br>F<br>E<br>V<br>1<br>อ<br>ย<br>ู<br>่<br>ใ<br>น<br>ช<br>่<br>ว<br>ง<br>3<br>0<br>%<br>ถ<br>ึ<br>ง<br>น<br>้<br>อ<br>ย<br>ก<br>ว<br>่<br>า<br>5<br>0<br>%<br>p<br>r<br>e<br>d<br>i<br>c<br>t<br>e<br>d<br><br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>ง<br>.<br>(<br>G<br>O<br>L<br>D<br>4<br>)<br>:<br>ร<br>ะ<br>ด<br>ั<br>บ<br>V<br>e<br>r<br>y<br>s<br>e<br>v<br>e<br>r<br>e<br>กำ<br>ห<br>น<br>ด<br>ค<br>่<br>า<br>p<br>o<br>s<br>t<br>-<br>b<br>r<br>o<br>n<br>c<br>h<br>o<br>d<br>i<br>l<br>a<br>t<br>o<br>r<br>F<br>E<br>V<br>1<br>น<br>้<br>อ<br>ย<br>ก<br>ว<br>่<br>า<br>3<br>0<br>%<br>p<br>r<br>e<br>d<br>i<br>c<br>t<br>e<br>d<br><br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>จ<br>.<br>(<br>G<br>O<br>L<br>D<br>5<br>)<br>:<br>ใ<br>น<br>แ<br>น<br>ว<br>ทำ<br>ง<br>เ<br>ว<br>ช<br>ป<br>ฏ<br>ิ<br>บ<br>ั<br>ต<br>ิ<br>G<br>O<br>L<br>D<br>ไ<br>ม<br>่<br>ม<br>ี<br>ร<br>ะ<br>ด<br>ั<br>บ<br>ค<br>วำ<br>ม<br>ร<br>ุ<br>น<br>แ<br>ร<br>ง<br>ร<br>ะ<br>ด<br>ั<br>บ<br>5<br>โ<br>ด<br>ย<br>ร<br>ะ<br>บ<br>บ<br>จำ<br>แ<br>น<br>ก<br>ม<br>ี<br>เ<br>พ<br>ี<br>ย<br>ง<br>ร<br>ะ<br>ด<br>ั<br>บ<br>1<br>ถ<br>ึ<br>ง<br>4<br>เ<br>ท<br>่<br>า<br>น<br>ั<br>้<br>น",
