      "explanation": "✅ คำตอบที่ถูกต้อง: ข้อ ค. Duloxetine<br>🎯 ทำไมข้อนี้ถึงถูก: Duloxetine เป็นยาในกลุ่ม Serotonin-Norepinephrine Reuptake Inhibitor (SNRI) ที่มีข้อบ่งใช้ในการรักษาภาวะปัสสาวะเล็ดขณะไอ จาม หรือออกแรง (Stress Urinary Incontinence: SUI) ในสตรี โดยยับยั้งการดูดกลับของ 5-HT และ NE ใน Onuf nucleus ของไขสันหลังระดับ sacral ทำให้เพิ่มการกระตุ้น pudendal nerve ส่งผลให้ external urethral sphincter บีบตัวแข็งแรงขึ้น<br>🔍 ข้ออื่นผิดเพราะอะไร:<br><br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>ก<br>.<br>(<br>F<br>u<br>r<br>o<br>s<br>e<br>m<br>i<br>d<br>e<br>)<br>:<br>เ<br>ป<br>็<br>น<br>ยำ<br>ข<br>ั<br>บ<br>ป<br>ั<br>ส<br>สำ<br>ว<br>ะ<br>ก<br>ล<br>ุ<br>่<br>ม<br>L<br>o<br>o<br>p<br>d<br>i<br>u<br>r<br>e<br>t<br>i<br>c<br>s<br>เ<br>พ<br>ิ<br>่<br>ม<br>ป<br>ร<br>ิ<br>มำ<br>ต<br>ร<br>ป<br>ั<br>ส<br>สำ<br>ว<br>ะ<br>ทำ<br>ใ<br>ห<br>้<br>อำ<br>กำ<br>ร<br>ป<br>ั<br>ส<br>สำ<br>ว<br>ะ<br>เ<br>ล<br>็<br>ด<br>รำ<br>ด<br>แ<br>ย<br>่<br>ล<br>ง<br>(<br>w<br>o<br>r<br>s<br>e<br>n<br>s<br>u<br>r<br>i<br>n<br>a<br>r<br>y<br>i<br>n<br>c<br>o<br>n<br>t<br>i<br>n<br>e<br>n<br>c<br>e<br>)<br><br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>ข<br>.<br>(<br>E<br>n<br>a<br>l<br>a<br>p<br>r<br>i<br>l<br>)<br>:<br>เ<br>ป<br>็<br>น<br>ยำ<br>ก<br>ล<br>ุ<br>่<br>ม<br>A<br>C<br>E<br>i<br>n<br>h<br>i<br>b<br>i<br>t<br>o<br>r<br>s<br>ม<br>ี<br>ผ<br>ล<br>ข<br>้<br>า<br>ง<br>เ<br>ค<br>ี<br>ย<br>ง<br>ทำ<br>ใ<br>ห<br>้<br>ไ<br>อ<br>แ<br>ห<br>้<br>ง<br>เ<br>ร<br>ื<br>้<br>อ<br>ร<br>ั<br>ง<br>(<br>c<br>h<br>r<br>o<br>n<br>i<br>c<br>d<br>r<br>y<br>c<br>o<br>u<br>g<br>h<br>)<br>ซ<br>ึ<br>่<br>ง<br>จ<br>ะ<br>ก<br>ร<br>ะ<br>ต<br>ุ<br>้<br>น<br>ใ<br>ห<br>้<br>เ<br>ก<br>ิ<br>ด<br>s<br>t<br>r<br>e<br>s<br>s<br>i<br>n<br>c<br>o<br>n<br>t<br>i<br>n<br>e<br>n<br>c<br>e<br>เ<br>ล<br>็<br>ด<br>รำ<br>ด<br>มำ<br>ก<br>ข<br>ึ<br>้<br>น<br><br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>ง<br>.<br>(<br>V<br>e<br>n<br>l<br>a<br>f<br>a<br>x<br>i<br>n<br>e<br>)<br>:<br>แ<br>ม<br>้<br>เ<br>ป<br>็<br>น<br>S<br>N<br>R<br>I<br>แ<br>ต<br>่<br>ไ<br>ม<br>่<br>ม<br>ี<br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>บ<br>่<br>ง<br>ใ<br>ช<br>้<br>ท<br>ี<br>่<br>ไ<br>ด<br>้<br>ร<br>ั<br>บ<br>กำ<br>ร<br>ร<br>ั<br>บ<br>ร<br>อ<br>ง<br>ห<br>ร<br>ื<br>อ<br>ห<br>ล<br>ั<br>ก<br>ฐำ<br>น<br>ป<br>ร<br>ะ<br>ส<br>ิ<br>ท<br>ธ<br>ิ<br>ผ<br>ล<br>ใ<br>น<br>กำ<br>ร<br>ร<br>ั<br>ก<br>ษำ<br>s<br>t<br>r<br>e<br>s<br>s<br>u<br>r<br>i<br>n<br>a<br>r<br>y<br>i<br>n<br>c<br>o<br>n<br>t<br>i<br>n<br>e<br>n<br>c<br>e<br>เ<br>ห<br>ม<br>ื<br>อ<br>น<br>D<br>u<br>l<br>o<br>x<br>e<br>t<br>i<br>n<br>e<br><br>ข<br>้<br>อ<br>จ<br>.<br>(<br>N<br>o<br>r<br>t<br>r<br>i<br>p<br>t<br>y<br>l<br>i<br>n<br>e<br>)<br>:<br>เ<br>ป<br>็<br>น<br>ยำ<br>ต<br>้<br>า<br>น<br>ซ<br>ึ<br>ม<br>เ<br>ศ<br>ร<br>้<br>า<br>ก<br>ล<br>ุ<br>่<br>ม<br>T<br>C<br>A<br>ม<br>ี<br>a<br>n<br>t<br>i<br>c<br>h<br>o<br>l<br>i<br>n<br>e<br>r<br>g<br>i<br>c<br>s<br>i<br>d<br>e<br>e<br>f<br>f<br>e<br>c<br>t<br>s<br>อำ<br>จ<br>ทำ<br>ใ<br>ห<br>้<br>ป<br>ั<br>ส<br>สำ<br>ว<br>ะ<br>ค<br>ั<br>่<br>ง<br>(<br>u<br>r<br>i<br>n<br>a<br>r<br>y<br>r<br>e<br>t<br>e<br>n<br>t<br>i<br>o<br>n<br>)<br>แ<br>ล<br>ะ<br>เ<br>ก<br>ิ<br>ด<br>o<br>v<br>e<br>r<br>f<br>l<br>o<br>w<br>i<br>n<br>c<br>o<br>n<br>t<br>i<br>n<br>e<br>n<br>c<br>e<br>ตำ<br>ม<br>มำ",
