      "id": "4. Preformulation & GMP::60",
      "itemNo": 59,
      "category": "4. Preformulation & GMP",
      "topic": "Product Group 4: Preformulation & GMP",
      "subtopic": "4.4 Good Manufacturing Practice",
      "track": "Product",
      "question": "ข้อใดต่อไปนี้ \"ไม่ใช่\" ข้อดีของรูปแบบยาชนิดควบคุมการปลดปล่อย (Controlled-release / Sustained-release dosage forms)",
      "questionImage": "",
