      "question": "[]<br>ตารางเกณฑ์ Dissolution (Q = 80%):<br>- Stage S1 (Number Tested: 6): Each unit is not less than Q + 5%.<br>- Stage S2 (Number Tested: 6): Average of 12 units (S1 + S2) is equal to or greater than Q, and no unit is less than Q - 15%.<br>- Stage S3 (Number Tested: 12): Average of 24 units (S1 + S2 + S3) is equal to or greater than Q, not more than 2 units are less than Q - 15%, and no unit is less than Q - 25%.<br><br>คำถาม: ข้อใดถูกเกี่ยวกับการทดสอบ dissolution (Q = 80%) [อ้างอิงตารางเกณฑ์ Acceptance Criteria S1, S2, S3]",
